Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}New Teammate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 22
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.97,0:00:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you’re the ones causing trouble in my territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your people attacked us first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.41,0:00:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Could he be Yaozu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,To think you actually know my younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.17,0:00:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s elsewhere right now, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.21,0:00:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am his elder brother. My name is Guangzong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My men have had a taste of your skills; you’re pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.81,0:00:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.57,0:00:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you cooperate with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.37,0:01:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,all the treasures in here will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.97,0:01:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but we’re not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.65,0:01:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve suddenly got hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.93,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We have important business right now; please step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.97,0:01:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be some misunderstanding here. Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.05,0:01:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many paintings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.33,0:01:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.21,0:01:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.02,0:01:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No amount of delicious food can stop us from wanting to find our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.85,0:01:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.25,0:01:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I completely understand your desire to find your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.89,0:01:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I am looking for my daughter, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.41,0:01:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,An incident recently occurred at an inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.69,0:02:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Reports state that the incident involved several people, including Blue Scarf and Cha Erlang.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.49,0:02:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you bear to see my young daughter…by this person…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.49,0:02:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.13,0:02:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did this news report take place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.30,0:02:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re looking for this person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.93,0:02:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this person a friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.81,0:02:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My men saw him with my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.29,0:02:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But then a sandstorm hit,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.01,0:02:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and they lost track of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.21,0:02:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.33,0:02:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Since your friend is with my daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,you really must help me find them quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.93,0:02:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Because some dangerous people might harm them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.17,0:02:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially that man named Cha Erlang.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.73,0:02:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If my daughter—or your friend—falls into his hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.49,0:02:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,the chances of survival would be slim.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.33,0:02:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He sounds just like Chay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.77,0:02:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now isn’t the time to think about such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.97,0:02:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, we need to protect Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.46,0:02:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree. Since we share the same goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.49,0:02:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,let me entrust you with a task.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:03:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me defeat Cha Erlang and save my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,When the time comes, besides an endless supply of food and water,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,you will also become my heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.93,0:03:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.78,0:03:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And most importantly, we can save our Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.81,0:03:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll work with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.61,0:03:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.41,0:03:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.93,0:03:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a vehicle for your journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.45,0:03:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Find them as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.52,0:03:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.33,0:03:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it going, Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Reporting, Boss—everything is going smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.29,0:03:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll be bringing the water back right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.65,0:03:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.73,0:04:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll reward you handsomely when you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood, Boss. Thank you, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.81,0:04:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, this is yours, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.21,0:04:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.85,0:04:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The Boss will definitely value us more after this trip back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.89,0:04:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear a noise just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.25,0:04:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have misheard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.73,0:04:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.29,0:04:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s someone inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.22,0:04:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Go check the back and see what’s happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.93,0:04:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the shaking just now knock the door open?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.73,0:04:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone really is stealing water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.97,0:04:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can’t I suck any more out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.29,0:05:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.85,0:05:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.97,0:05:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did you sneak a drink of my water, but you’re even taking some to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.97,0:05:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.45,0:05:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But you seem a bit different from Planie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.29,0:05:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, thanks for the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.25,0:05:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.21,0:05:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about running.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.01,0:05:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the water down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.74,0:05:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.49,0:05:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Give the ball back to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.77,0:05:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.22,0:05:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Brother Planie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.33,0:05:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re welcome. Mr. Slowy put me in charge of guarding the Goats’ Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.09,0:05:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It is my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.97,0:05:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Guarding the Goats’ Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.89,0:05:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can protect Goats’ Village just like the Defenders do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You really…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.85,0:05:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do to Planie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.53,0:05:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.41,0:06:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m giving him a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.57,0:06:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to give him a flower to encourage him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.73,0:06:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.73,0:06:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.77,0:06:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay, what brings you to Goats’ Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I went to Wolf Fortress to look for Uncle Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Aunt Wolnie said that both Uncle Wolffy and Weslie had gone missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.41,0:06:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So I came to Goats’ Village to see if you had any new information.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.89,0:06:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi and Sparky have already gone to look for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.58,0:06:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You can rest easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.05,0:06:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.65,0:06:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I…I…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.25,0:06:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.45,0:06:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re the good guys…you…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, whenever I get nervous, I just want to…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.60,0:06:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He even took so much water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.81,0:06:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Good chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:07:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Good kids remember not to point random, strange objects at people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.34,0:07:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.84,0:07:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.45,0:07:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And also…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.29,0:07:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re clearly a doll—how can you talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.78,0:07:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you look a lot like a friend from my hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.45,0:07:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a long story regarding this doll body of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.45,0:07:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s just say…you could understand it as me not being from around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not from around here either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.33,0:07:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I’m not from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.69,0:07:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not from this world either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.57,0:07:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how did you end up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.76,0:07:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I come from a world called “Lüyouyou”.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A rift appeared in my world and swept me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Life here is incredibly hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.53,0:07:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But I’ve never given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I’ve been waiting for a chance to go back and save our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.01,0:07:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,To get powerful weapons, I have to acquire more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:08:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,When you went to haul water earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I snuck onto your vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.49,0:08:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What I did was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But without water, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.89,0:08:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry; I’ll accept whatever consequences come my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.09,0:08:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If you realize you were wrong, at least there’s still a chance to make amends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.09,0:08:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve found the water thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole all the water from my home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How is my family supposed to survive without water?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole water from so many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.56,0:08:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I only took a little bit from each person…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking it is taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.05,0:08:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s take him back and interrogate him properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.85,0:08:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Give the water back to me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.77,0:08:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They want the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.09,0:08:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.14,0:08:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If I complete the mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.54,0:09:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I might just get the map to the rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.33,0:09:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can’t just leave Planie to his fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.81,0:09:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I think…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.96,0:09:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren’t thinking of meddling in other people’s business, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.21,0:09:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie made a mistake, and I want to help him make amends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about our reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.37,0:09:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He just wants to survive and save his world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s help him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.68,0:09:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll compensate you for the water on his behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he’d compensate us for the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.49,0:09:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares who pays? As long as we get the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.06,0:09:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry for causing you trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.77,0:09:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t do things like that again; it’s wrong and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.45,0:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going? What are your plans for the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.93,0:10:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re both in the same boat—two lost souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.53,0:10:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t you just tag along with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, even though you’re just a ragdoll.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.89,0:10:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not a ragdoll; I’m Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.21,0:10:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Could the Wolffy from his world be just like I used to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.45,0:10:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But you’re very different from the Wolffy in our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re the first good person I’ve met here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.02,0:10:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, good guy Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.61,0:10:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Just having one good person like me isn’t enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.61,0:10:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We need more good people to save this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.09,0:10:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We’d better figure out what to do ourselves first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So much of the water is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.13,0:10:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we going to explain this to Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to try this method.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.53,0:11:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, I knew I picked the right guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay, you did a great job too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.13,0:11:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren’t bad yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.37,0:11:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute—who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.61,0:11:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Reporting, Boss: we ran into him on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.53,0:11:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He has nowhere to go right now; he’s just wandering around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.73,0:11:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Anyone lost in this wasteland
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.41,0:11:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,is someone I’ll save if I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.69,0:11:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, you have such a kind heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.37,0:11:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, you are truly wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.21,0:11:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll have the first drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.86,0:11:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there so much sand in the water? What’s going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.81,0:11:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be Guangzong? Did he know you were coming to fetch water and deliberately sabotage it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.45,0:11:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait, Guangzong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.01,0:12:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,See how I deal with you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.61,0:12:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Boss, didn’t you say you were going to give us a reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.57,0:12:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.57,0:12:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.57,0:12:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly—the reward is for you to drink your fill of this water along with everyone else.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
